+[Исходник](alternatives/lmx/S06_core.lm3). В основной коэффициент не входит.
+
+```lmx
+Negative:
+    int: value
+    return: int
+    accepts:
+        return: value < 0
+
+Example:
+    int[]: items
+    return: int
+    run:
+        throws: copy(FxThrows\predicate) FxRecordArity
+        @: found index(items; Negative\accepts)
+        if: found\present = 0
+            return: -1
+        return: \found\value
+```
+
