+[Исходник](source/lmx/S10.lm3).
+
+```lmx
+Addition:
+    int: first
+    int: second
+    return: int
+    add:
+        return: first + second
+
+Example:
+    int: value
+    return: int
+    run:
+        throws: copy(FxThrows\capture)
+        @: add5 partial(Addition\add; (5))
+        return: add5(value)
+```
+
+## Common Lisp / SBCL
+
+[Исходник](source/common-lisp/S10.lisp).
+
+```common-lisp
+(defun make-adder (first)
+  (lambda (second) (+ first second)))
+
+(defun example (value)
+  (let ((add5 (make-adder 5)))
+    (funcall add5 value)))
+```
