+
+## LMX
+
+[Исходник](source/lmx/S18.lm3).
+
+```lmx
+Rectangle:
+    int: width 0
+    int: height 0
+    return: int
+    area:
+        return: width * height
+
+Square:
+    int: side 0
+    return: int
+    area:
+        return: side * side
+
+Example:
+    int: width
+    int: height
+    int: side
+    return: @
+    run:
+        @: rectangle (copy(Rectangle))
+        rectangle := parent(rectangle\area)
+        @: square (copy(Square))
