+        throws: copy(FxThrows\sequence) PatternArgument PatternEncoding PatternPosition
+        return: replace(byteText(text); (asciiDigit atLeast 1); Mask\make)
+```
+
+## Perl
+
+[Исходник](source/perl/P19.pl).
+
+```perl
